GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. See LICENSE.md.

Our modifications are released under the same licence. The full source of the
version running at https://content.usetantra.com is published at
https://github.com/adisuja/tantra-content-engine.

Tantra code lives in app/Tantra, database/migrations/tantra,
resources/js/pages/tantra, resources/js/components/tantra and lang/*/tantra.php.
Small changes to upstream files are marked with a "tantra:" comment.
